Read the complete article and supplementary methods. Selected formulation, rheo-Raman, normalization, conditioning, compliance, conversion and thermal-history passages were inspected on 30 October 2026. Distinguish measured rheological behavior and the proposed schedule from a complete validation of a finished printed component. The dataset citation was verified, but its files could not be inspected.

